# Cafe Zauner floor (solid, Stage 9): a chequerboard of 8x8 marble
# squares, pale w with i veins and grey i with m veins (seamless at the
# 16 px pitch), a 1 px c lip on top (the walking surface).
# It runs wall to wall: only the N bit changes the look (lip or not).
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_marmor
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
